771 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 481 0 R
/E (Regarding case materials, the most common cases are made of stamped sheet metal \(chapa troquelada\) with a plastic front panel. Stamped sheet metal is a very economical material, but it does not provide much rigidity.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [5]
>>
