797 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 484 0 R
/E (The motherboard is a fundamental component in a computer system. Generally, a good motherboard ensures an efficient system. Sometimes it is better to invest a computer's budget in buying a better motherboard than a better microprocessor, because the system's performance will be higher.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
798 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 484 0 R
/E (The motherboard format is called the form factor. The same format has been in use for a long time. The ATX \(Advanced Technology eXtended\) was one of the most )
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
799 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 484 0 R
